      "settings": {
        "eyebrow": "OUR APPROACH",
        "heading": "Architect, validate and optimize with one senior team",
        "body_primary": "<p>We lead technical discovery, benchmark testing, architecture design, and production rollout with the exact same cloud and AI architects — so nothing gets lost between pre-sales promises and production reality. Every quota tier, network topology, and model routing strategy is benchmarked and verified against your real workloads before any contract is signed.</p>",
        "body_secondary": "<p>That means you deploy with guaranteed quota baselines and predictable cloud unit costs, not vague estimates. You never suffer launch-day 429 throttles, hidden egress traps, or runaway inference bills — and you retain full infrastructure code (IaC), monitoring dashboards, and root architecture control at the end.</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/AI-Cloud-approach.png",
        "image_alt": "",
        "font": "montserrat_n5",
        "text_color": "#000000",
        "heading_gradient": "linear-gradient(122.1396deg, rgba(11, 34, 184, 1) 11.742%, rgba(150, 33, 196, 1) 88.258%)",
